## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `python app.py` and confirm the server starts without errors on `http://127.0.0.1:5000`.
- Use the browser tool to navigate to `http://127.0.0.1:5000` and verify the upload page renders correctly.

### Manual Verification
1. Start the server: `cd d:\Brain_Tumor_Segmentation\App && python app.py`
2. Open `http://127.0.0.1:5000` in browser
3. Upload a `.nii.gz` brain MRI file (4-channel, BraTS format)
4. Verify that the result page shows segmentation visualizations
5. (You will need to provide a test `.nii.gz` file to fully test the inference end-to-end)
